  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ClickablePart
  partTitle: COOLED SCREW CONVEYOR
  partDescription: "Carries ~4,940 kg/h of hot solids \u2014 dense E-glass fiber
    mixed with coarse carbon char \u2014 from the hood funnel up to the separation
    tower. Water-cooled and nitrogen-flushed; the compacting screw forms a solid
    material plug that doubles as a pressure seal against the kiln atmosphere."
